<title>UK: BICC expects to maintain final dividend.</title>
<headline>BICC expects to maintain final dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BICC Plc, the cable to construction group, said on Thursday it expected to maintain its final dividend at 8.5 pence per share, making a total of 12.5 pence for the year.</p>
<p>BICC announced earlier plans for a 170 million rights issue for investment in development opprtortunities.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
